1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
This school bus crosses

2
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:02,467
an international border

3
00:00:02,467 --> 00:00:03,600
four times a day.

4
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:04,867
And the school is

5
00:00:04,867 --> 00:00:05,933
in the same state.

6
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:07,200
In 1846,

7
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:08,500
the Oregon Treaty

8
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:09,700
extended the border

9
00:00:09,700 --> 00:00:10,700
along the 49th parallel.

10
00:00:10,700 --> 00:00:12,433
That put the tip
of this peninsula

11
00:00:12,433 --> 00:00:13,967
in Washington.

12
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:15,100
From Point Roberts,

13
00:00:15,100 --> 00:00:16,867
the bus goes into Canada,

14
00:00:16,867 --> 00:00:18,133
then back into the U.S.

15
00:00:18,133 --> 00:00:19,533
at Blaine.

16
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:21,000
After school?

17
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:22,967
Same trip in reverse.

18
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:24,767
All for a school

19
00:00:24,767 --> 00:00:25,800
in Washington.
